A. Commit message:
Add PEBS format 6 support for older kernel version

B. Change summary:
This patch backports the addition of PEBS format 6 support from a newer kernel version to an older one. The changes ensure that the legacy PEBS features can be utilized without requiring new counters snapshotting enabling patches.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

D. Fixed Code:
```diff
diff --git a/arch/x86/events/intel/ds.c b/arch/x86/events/intel/ds.c
index 1a4b326ca2ce1..6ba6549f26fac 100644
--- a/arch/x86/events/intel/ds.c
+++ b/arch/x86/events/intel/ds.c
@@ -2517,6 +2517,7 @@ void __init intel_ds_init(void)
 			x86_pmu.large_pebs_flags |= PERF_SAMPLE_TIME;
 			break;
 
+		case 6:
 		case 5:
 			x86_pmu.pebs_ept = 1;
 			fallthrough;
```